  "title": "Multi-Project dbt Lineage: See Dependencies Across Your Entire Data Stack",
  "summary": "Most teams running dbt at scale split their work into multiple projects by domain or transformation stage. This creates a visibility gap: lineage stops at project boundaries, making it hard to trace root causes, assess downstream impact, or route incidents to the right teams. Elementary's multi-project lineage builds a unified dependency graph across all dbt projects in your environment. See how data flows end-to-end and debug incidents faster without manually stitching context together.",
